<h2>1. Information we collect</h2><p>Stonefellow may collect information you provide directly, including account details, contact and demo-request information, profile details, and music-workflow content you choose to upload or enter. We may also collect technical information needed to operate and secure the service, such as IP address, browser or device information, timestamps, and service activity.</p>
<h2>2. How we use information</h2><p>We use information to provide and secure Stonefellow, authenticate accounts, organize your projects and workflow data, respond to support and demo requests, improve reliability, prevent abuse, and communicate about the service.</p>
<h2>3. Music, files and workspace content</h2><p>You retain ownership of the music, stems, notes, metadata, documents and other content you submit. Stonefellow processes that content only as needed to provide the features you request, subject to these terms and any additional agreement that applies to your account.</p>
